# Generated experiment outputs (metrics, plots, demo data)
outputs/**
!outputs/README.md
# Exception: a small, reproducible set of *synthetic* demo artifacts is committed
# as reference output (see outputs/demo/README.md). The large raw demo CSV is
# still excluded and is regenerated with `neuralset-scaffold demo`.
!outputs/demo/
!outputs/demo/*.png
!outputs/demo/metrics.json
!outputs/demo/README.md
outputs/demo/*.csv

